# Secrets — never commit. Use .env.example as the template.
# Cognito Pool/Client IDs are public, but .env may also hold local overrides;
# all real secrets (Cloudinary secret, R2 keys, billing keys) live ONLY in
# Cloudflare Pages/Workers secrets + server Env, never with VITE_ prefix.
.env
.env.*.local
.dev.vars

